# Khadija Zaman

> AI Search Manager at Disrupt.com [Wellows]. SEO, AEO, and GEO run as one system, so brands rank in Google and get cited inside ChatGPT, Gemini, Perplexity, Claude, and Google AI Overviews. Results in the last 12 months, all organic, $0 paid: 22× LLM referral traffic (GA4), 680K → 3.78M Google impressions (GSC), 1,647 practitioners using the tools I built, including the Google-patent-based Query Fan-Out Generator that Search Engine Land picked to demonstrate query fan-out.

Khadija Zaman is AI Search Manager at Disrupt.com [Wellows], based in Karachi, Pakistan, working with clients worldwide. Her work grew Google Search Console impressions from 680K to 3.78M and increased LLM referral traffic 22× in 12 months, entirely through organic search with zero paid spend. She builds free public tools grounded in Google patent research, used by 1,647 practitioners across the UK, US, and EU.

This site covers her case studies, free SEO/AEO tools, and writing on how modern search visibility works across both traditional search engines and AI answer engines.

